Synthetic scorer self-test case: namespace-undeclared-member

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S2, S9

Scenario
src/payments/service.ts adds `import * as ordersApi from "../orders/service"`, and refund() calls ordersApi.getOrder() and ordersApi.getOrderTotal().

Expected
One UNDECLARED_SYMBOL finding, for getOrder only. getOrderTotal appears in payments ## dependencies, and the concept Orders is declared.

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.

Deliberately not asserted
